      "description": "For an unassuming high school nestled in the suburbs of Illinois, the name \"Oak Forest High School\" (OFHS) has exploded onto the global search landscape, baffli...",
      "urlToImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461896836934-ffe607ba8211?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80",
